        text: "Villages have their own people and reagents. Press T to tend the place once a day, and E to talk.",
    ),
    (
        id: "tut_disposal_choice",
        trigger: "first_disposal_choice",
        text: "Dig a grave with the Shovel [2] + F, or light the incinerator with F. Burying and burning mean different things to each side.",
    ),
